<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>读后感与结论</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>12 / 12</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '18px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>它强在哪</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>解决真实采集痛点而非刷指标；乱序只掉 0.5 dB；分钟级 vs 小时级；工程完整、可直接用。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>它弱在哪</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>纯旋转 / 低视差失败；图传播精度不及全局 BA；依赖一长串上游模型；层级阈值靠经验。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>往哪走</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>竞争点从"重建质量"转向"采集体验"：实时提示覆盖不足、重投影误差，甚至主动规划拍摄路径。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ margin: '20px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '18px 22px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>一句话总结：它用"图上的距离"换掉了"全局优化的解"，把 3DGS 从离线工具变成了采集现场的仪表盘。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>复现心得：真正拖住复现的往往不是论文里的算法，而是 CUDA 架构、子模块层级、权重来源这些"隐性依赖"——这也是课程要求写"代码分析"的意义。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '22px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>谢谢，欢迎提问</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>论文：SIGGRAPH 2026 / arXiv:2607.14481 · 代码：github.com/graphdeco-inria/i3dgs</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
